==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldstrich]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Alpacky]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldstrich]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The combination of dual Oldstrich, Kang Roo spam led by 600% SBKs and additional backliners like Alpacky and Mr. Mole make this stage rather difficult to tackle head on. As a result, it is advised to take advantage of the Relic Doge Base and cheese this stage using money-up combos, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] for the startoff and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] once you have the cash. From there, spam as many other rusher units as possible and take down the base before the first Oldstrich spawns.

Should the cheese be patched out, such as in higher crowned difficulties, bring your best answers to Oldstrich with options such as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]], [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong]] and [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Island]], as well as units that can chip the Alpacky and Mr. Mole periodically or as cleanup. [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] are both good answers in that regard. Make sure to bring [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to finish off both Oldstriches.

==Trivia==
*Shadows Abound's name references the multiple [[Shadow Boxer K]]s present in the stage.

